<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
  <title>Découpeur de tickets</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'><text y='.9em' font-size='90'>✂️</text></svg>">
  
  <!-- Bibliothèques épinglées depuis cdnjs.cloudflare.com -->
  <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/pdf.js/3.11.174/pdf.min.js"></script>
  <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/pdf-lib/1.17.1/pdf-lib.min.js"></script>
  <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/jszip/3.10.1/jszip.min.js"></script>

  <style>
    /* Variables de thème clair (par défaut) */
    :root {
      --bg-app: #f3f4f6;
      --bg-surface: #ffffff;
      --bg-subtle: #f9fafb;
      --bg-canvas-wrap: #e5e7eb;
      --text-main: #111827;
      --text-muted: #4b5563;
      --text-light: #6b7280;
      --border: #d1d5db;
      --border-subtle: #e5e7eb;
      --primary: #2563eb;
      --primary-hover: #1d4ed8;
      --primary-soft: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.14);
      --danger: #dc2626;
      --danger-hover: #b91c1c;
      --danger-soft: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.12);
      --success: #059669;
      --success-soft: rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.12);
      --frame-stroke: #2563eb;
      --frame-fill: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.12);
      --frame-selected: #f59e0b;
      --frame-selected-fill: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.16);
      --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
      --shadow-md: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      --radius: 12px;
      --radius-sm: 8px;
    }

    /* Thème sombre automatique si non forcé en clair */
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      :root:not([data-theme="light"]) {
        --bg-app: #0f172a;
        --bg-surface: #1e293b;
        --bg-subtle: #0f172a;
        --bg-canvas-wrap: #020617;
        --text-main: #f8fafc;
        --text-muted: #cbd5e1;
        --text-light: #94a3b8;
        --border: #334155;
        --border-subtle: #1e293b;
        --primary: #3b82f6;
        --primary-hover: #60a5fa;
        --primary-soft: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);
        --danger: #ef4444;
        --danger-hover: #f87171;
        --danger-soft: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.18);
        --success: #10b981;
        --success-soft: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.18);
        --frame-stroke: #3b82f6;
        --frame-fill: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.18);
        --frame-selected: #fbbf24;
        --frame-selected-fill: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.22);
        --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        --shadow-md: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
      }
    }

    /* Thème sombre forcé manuellement */
    :root[data-theme="dark"] {
      --bg-app: #0f172a;
      --bg-surface: #1e293b;
      --bg-subtle: #0f172a;
      --bg-canvas-wrap: #020617;
      --text-main: #f8fafc;
      --text-muted: #cbd5e1;
      --text-light: #94a3b8;
      --border: #334155;
      --border-subtle: #1e293b;
      --primary: #3b82f6;
      --primary-hover: #60a5fa;
      --primary-soft: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);
      --danger: #ef4444;
      --danger-hover: #f87171;
      --danger-soft: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.18);
      --success: #10b981;
      --success-soft: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.18);
      --frame-stroke: #3b82f6;
      --frame-fill: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.18);
      --frame-selected: #fbbf24;
      --frame-selected-fill: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.22);
      --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      --shadow-md: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    html, body {
      height: 100%;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--bg-app);
      color: var(--text-main);
      line-height: 1.45;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    body {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      padding-top: env(safe-area-inset-top);
      padding-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom);
      padding-left: env(safe-area-inset-left);
      padding-right: env(safe-area-inset-right);
    }

    /* En-tête */
    header {
      background-color: var(--bg-surface);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 12px 20px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .brand-icon {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .brand h1 {
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }

    .brand-badge {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background-color: var(--primary-soft);
      color: var(--primary);
    }

    .header-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    /* Boutons génériques */
    button {
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background-color: var(--bg-surface);
      color: var(--text-main);
      padding: 8px 12px;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 6px;
      transition: background-color 0.15s, border-color 0.15s, opacity 0.15s, transform 0.05s;
      user-select: none;
    }

    button:hover:not(:disabled) {
      background-color: var(--bg-subtle);
      border-color: var(--text-light);
    }

    button:active:not(:disabled) {
      transform: translateY(1px);
    }

    button:disabled {
      opacity: 0.45;
      cursor: not-allowed;
    }

    button.btn-primary {
      background-color: var(--primary);
      border-color: var(--primary);
      color: #ffffff;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    button.btn-primary:hover:not(:disabled) {
      background-color: var(--primary-hover);
      border-color: var(--primary-hover);
    }

    button.btn-danger-outline {
      color: var(--danger);
      border-color: var(--border);
    }

    button.btn-danger-outline:hover:not(:disabled) {
      background-color: var(--danger-soft);
      border-color: var(--danger);
    }

    button.btn-sm {
      padding: 6px 10px;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
    }

    .hidden {
      display: none !important;
    }

    /* Écran d'accueil / Zone de dépôt */
    #drop-view {
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .drop-card {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 560px;
      background-color: var(--bg-surface);
      border: 2px dashed var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 48px 28px;
      text-align: center;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: border-color 0.2s, background-color 0.2s, transform 0.15s;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    }

    .drop-card:hover, .drop-card.dragover {
      border-color: var(--primary);
      background-color: var(--primary-soft);
    }

    .drop-icon {
      width: 56px;
      height: 56px;
      margin: 0 auto 16px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background-color: var(--primary-soft);
      color: var(--primary);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.75rem;
    }

    .drop-card h2 {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .drop-card p {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.925rem;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .drop-formats {
      display: inline-flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .format-pill {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 3px 9px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      background-color: var(--bg-app);
      color: var(--text-muted);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .privacy-note {
      margin-top: 16px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--text-light);
    }

    .error-banner {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 560px;
      margin-top: 16px;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      background-color: var(--danger-soft);
      border: 1px solid var(--danger);
      color: var(--danger);
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    /* Espace de travail principal (2 colonnes) */
    #workspace-view {
      flex: 1;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 300px;
      min-height: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    /* Colonne gauche : visualisation */
    .viewer-column {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      min-width: 0;
      min-height: 0;
      background-color: var(--bg-canvas-wrap);
    }

    .viewer-toolbar {
      background-color: var(--bg-surface);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 8px 16px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .nav-group {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .page-indicator {
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      min-width: 95px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .counter-badge {
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      background-color: var(--bg-app);
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .canvas-scroll-area {
      flex: 1;
      overflow: auto;
      padding: 20px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .stage-wrapper {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 760px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 4px;
      line-height: 0;
      user-select: none;
    }

    #page-canvas {
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      display: block;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    #overlay-layer {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      touch-action: none;
      cursor: crosshair;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    #quad-svg {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      pointer-events: none;
      overflow: visible;
    }

    .quad-poly {
      fill: var(--frame-fill);
      stroke: var(--frame-stroke);
      stroke-width: 2;
      vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;
      pointer-events: all;
      cursor: move;
      transition: fill 0.1s;
    }

    .quad-poly.selected {
      fill: var(--frame-selected-fill);
      stroke: var(--frame-selected);
      stroke-width: 2.5;
    }

    .quad-handle {
      fill: #ffffff;
      stroke: var(--frame-selected);
      stroke-width: 2;
      vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;
      pointer-events: all;
      cursor: grab;
    }

    .quad-handle:active {
      cursor: grabbing;
    }

    .quad-edge-hit {
      fill: none;
      stroke: transparent;
      stroke-width: 14;
      vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;
      pointer-events: stroke;
      cursor: copy;
    }

    .quad-del-group {
      pointer-events: all;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .quad-del-group:hover rect {
      fill: var(--danger-hover);
    }

    /* Cadres de tickets dans l'overlay */
    .ticket-box {
      position: absolute;
      border: 2px solid var(--frame-stroke);
      background-color: var(--frame-fill);
      cursor: move;
      touch-action: none;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      transition: background-color 0.1s;
    }

    .ticket-box.selected {
      border-color: var(--frame-selected);
      background-color: var(--frame-selected-fill);
      z-index: 10;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
    }

    .ticket-badge {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      background-color: var(--frame-stroke);
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1;
      padding: 3px 6px;
      border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .ticket-box.selected .ticket-badge {
      background-color: var(--frame-selected);
      color: #111827;
    }

    .ticket-delete {
      position: absolute;
      top: -1px;
      right: -1px;
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 0 0 0 5px;
      background-color: var(--danger);
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1;
      padding: 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      cursor: pointer;
      z-index: 12;
    }

    .ticket-delete:hover {
      background-color: var(--danger-hover);
    }

    /* 8 poignées de redimensionnement */
    .resize-handle {
      position: absolute;
      width: 11px;
      height: 11px;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border: 2px solid var(--frame-selected);
      border-radius: 50%;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      z-index: 15;
      touch-action: none;
    }

    .ticket-box:not(.selected) .resize-handle {
      display: none;
    }

    .handle-nw { top: 0%; left: 0%; cursor: nwse-resize; }
    .handle-n  { top: 0%; left: 50%; cursor: ns-resize; }
    .handle-ne { top: 0%; left: 100%; cursor: nesw-resize; }
    .handle-e  { top: 50%; left: 100%; cursor: ew-resize; }
    .handle-se { top: 100%; left: 100%; cursor: nwse-resize; }
    .handle-s  { top: 100%; left: 50%; cursor: ns-resize; }
    .handle-sw { top: 100%; left: 0%; cursor: nesw-resize; }
    .handle-w  { top: 50%; left: 0%; cursor: ew-resize; }

    /* Colonne droite : panneau d'outils 300px */
    .sidebar-column {
      width: 300px;
      background-color: var(--bg-surface);
      border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
      overflow-y: auto;
      padding: 14px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .tool-card {
      background-color: var(--bg-subtle);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 12px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .tool-card h3 {
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .btn-row {
      display: flex;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .btn-row > button {
      flex: 1;
    }

    .control-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 4px;
    }

    .control-label {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      color: var(--text-main);
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    input[type="range"] {
      width: 100%;
      accent-color: var(--primary);
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .grid-inputs {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    input[type="number"], select {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 6px 8px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background-color: var(--bg-surface);
      color: var(--text-main);
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
    }

    input[type="number"]:focus, select:focus {
      outline: 2px solid var(--primary);
      border-color: var(--primary);
    }

    .helper-note {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--text-light);
      line-height: 1.35;
    }

    .status-msg {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      padding: 7px 9px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      background-color: var(--primary-soft);
      color: var(--primary);
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 1.35;
    }

    .status-msg.warn {
      background-color: var(--danger-soft);
      color: var(--danger);
    }

    .status-msg.ok {
      background-color: var(--success-soft);
      color: var(--success);
    }

    .checkbox-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      color: var(--text-main);
      cursor: pointer;
      user-select: none;
    }

    .checkbox-row input[type="checkbox"] {
      width: 16px;
      height: 16px;
      accent-color: var(--primary);
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .progress-track {
      width: 100%;
      height: 6px;
      background-color: var(--border-subtle);
      border-radius: 999px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .progress-bar {
      height: 100%;
      width: 0%;
      background-color: var(--primary);
      transition: width 0.1s linear;
    }

    /* Responsive mobile : une seule colonne */
    @media (max-width: 820px) {
      #workspace-view {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        overflow-y: auto;
      }

      .viewer-column {
        min-height: 52vh;
      }

      .sidebar-column {
        width: 100%;
        border-left: none;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        overflow-y: visible;
      }
    }

    /* ===== Balance des blancs ===== */
    button.is-active { background: var(--primary); color: #fff; border-color: var(--primary); }
    #overlay-layer.wb-mode, #overlay-layer.wb-mode * { cursor: crosshair !important; }
    #overlay-layer.wb-mode .ticket-box, #overlay-layer.wb-mode .resize-handle,
    #overlay-layer.wb-mode .quad-handle, #overlay-layer.wb-mode .quad-edge-hit,
    #overlay-layer.wb-mode .quad-poly { pointer-events: none; }
    .wb-marker { fill: none; stroke: var(--frame-selected); stroke-width: 3; pointer-events: none; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 1.5px #000); }
    .wb-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
    .wb-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; width: 100%; text-align: left; font-size: 12px; }
    .wb-row.sel { border-color: var(--primary); background: var(--primary-soft); }
    .wb-chip { width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid var(--border); flex-shrink: 0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <span class="brand-icon" aria-hidden="true">✂️</span>
      <h1>Découpeur de tickets</h1>
      <span class="brand-badge">100 % local</span>
    </div>
    <div class="header-actions">
      <button type="button" id="btn-theme" class="btn-sm" title="Changer de thème">🌓 Thème</button>
      <button type="button" id="btn-reset-file" class="btn-sm hidden">Autre fichier</button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Vue 1 : Zone de dépôt -->
  <main id="drop-view">
    <div id="drop-zone" class="drop-card" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Zone de dépôt de fichiers">
      <div class="drop-icon">📄</div>
      <h2>Déposez votre PDF ou vos images</h2>
      <p>Glissez-déposez vos fichiers ici ou cliquez pour parcourir votre appareil.</p>
      <div class="drop-formats">
        <span class="format-pill">PDF</span>
        <span class="format-pill">PNG</span>
        <span class="format-pill">JPG</span>
        <span class="format-pill">WebP</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <button type="button" class="btn-primary">Choisir un ou plusieurs fichiers</button>
      </div>
      <p class="privacy-note">Vos fichiers restent strictement sur votre appareil. Aucun envoi vers un serveur.</p>
      <input type="file" id="file-input" class="hidden" accept=".pdf,image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp" multiple>
    </div>
    <div id="drop-error" class="error-banner hidden" role="alert"></div>
  </main>

  <!-- Vue 2 : Espace de travail -->
  <main id="workspace-view" class="hidden">
    <!-- Zone de visualisation à gauche -->
    <section class="viewer-column">
      <div class="viewer-toolbar">
        <div class="nav-group">
          <button type="button" id="btn-prev" class="btn-sm" aria-label="Page précédente">←</button>
          <span id="page-label" class="page-indicator">Page 1 / 1</span>
          <button type="button" id="btn-next" class="btn-sm" aria-label="Page suivante">→</button>
        </div>
        <button type="button" id="btn-wb" class="btn-sm" title="Cliquez ensuite sur une zone qui devrait être blanche">🎯 Balance des blancs</button>
        <div id="ticket-counter" class="counter-badge">0 ticket sur cette page · 0 au total</div>
      </div>

      <div class="canvas-scroll-area">
        <div id="stage-wrapper" class="stage-wrapper">
          <canvas id="page-canvas"></canvas>
          <div id="overlay-layer">
            <svg id="quad-svg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"></svg>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Panneau d'outils 300 px à droite -->
    <aside class="sidebar-column">
      <!-- Cadres manuels -->
      <div class="tool-card">
        <h3>Cadres & formes libres</h3>
        <p class="helper-note">Tracez un rectangle ou ajoutez une forme libre. Cliquez sur un bord pour ajouter autant de points que nécessaire (double-clic sur un point pour le retirer).</p>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <button type="button" id="btn-add-frame" class="btn-sm">+ Cadre</button>
          <button type="button" id="btn-add-quad" class="btn-sm">+ Forme libre</button>
        </div>
        <div class="btn-row">
